Optional browser transcription uses Transformers.js and Hugging Face
Tokenizers (Apache 2.0), Hugging Face Jinja (MIT), and ONNX Runtime (MIT).
Their license texts and ONNX Runtime third-party notices are included in
client/public/licenses/ and copied into browser distributions. Runtime
versions are pinned by package-lock.json. Model weights are downloaded
separately by an explicit operator command; the pinned model distribution
includes its MIT license and model card. See docs/audio.md.
